You are working in the Italy Trip Planner repo.

- The user-facing deliverable is `output/bardolino-trip-guide.html` (single offline file).
- Every trip is Bardolino → day trip → Bardolino, home before 18:00. This is not a road trip.
- Family: baby under 6 months, stroller, car, easy walks only, parking honesty required.
- Menu of ~18–22 same-day Bardolino loops (not a locked four-trip itinerary); Venice and a Lake Garda ferry day are mandatory menu entries; family picks 5–6 across 6 days; two base/nap days expected.
- Score destinations with parking 20%, baby 20%, beauty 15%, food 15%, walking 10%, safety 10%, effort 10%. Do not pick places for fame.
- No CDNs, no frameworks, no Google Fonts in the HTML.
- Do not ask the user to coordinate agents. If they ran `/generate-bardolino-guide`, follow `prompts/execute_pipeline.md`.
- Follow `CURSOR_RULES.md` and `PLAN.md`.
